msgstr "The request failed"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "Disable data dimension"
msgstr "Disable data dimension"

msgid "Disable the {{type}} \"{{name}}\" as a data dimension?"
msgstr "Disable the {{type}} \"{{name}}\" as a data dimension?"

msgid ""
"Favorites that use this dimension will stop working until it is re-enabled "
"in the Maintenance app. Analytics tables shrink at the next analytics run."
msgstr ""
"Favorites that use this dimension will stop working until it is re-enabled "
"in the Maintenance app. Analytics tables shrink at the next analytics run."

msgid "Disable"
msgstr "Disable"

msgid "About this tool"
msgstr "About this tool"

msgid ""
"Every metadata type enabled as a data dimension adds a column to the "
"analytics tables. This tool ranks them by how many favorites use them and "
"how often those favorites were opened in the last 12 months, so rarely used "
"dimensions can be disabled. Hover the info icon in the column headers for "
"definitions."
msgstr ""
"Every metadata type enabled as a data dimension adds a column to the "
"analytics tables. This tool ranks them by how many favorites use them and "
"how often those favorites were opened in the last 12 months, so rarely used "
"dimensions can be disabled. Hover the info icon in the column headers for "
"definitions."

msgid ""
"Favorites that use a disabled dimension stop working, and data set reports "
"show empty sub-totals for a disabled category (the Data set reports column "
"lists which), so check before disabling. A dimension can be re-enabled at "
"any time in the Maintenance app."
msgstr ""
"Favorites that use a disabled dimension stop working, and data set reports "
"show empty sub-totals for a disabled category (the Data set reports column "
"lists which), so check before disabling. A dimension can be re-enabled at "
"any time in the Maintenance app."

msgid "Remove the SQL view"
msgstr "Remove the SQL view"

msgid ""
"This deletes the SQL view \"{{name}}\" that the app installed. The app will "
"offer to recreate it the next time it is opened."
msgstr ""
"This deletes the SQL view \"{{name}}\" that the app installed. The app will "
"offer to recreate it the next time it is opened."

msgid "Remove SQL view"
msgstr "Remove SQL view"

msgid ""
"Your user needs the \"Add/Update SQL view\" authority (or the Superuser "
"role) to install the view."
msgstr ""
"Your user needs the \"Add/Update SQL view\" authority (or the Superuser "
"role) to install the view."

msgid "Could not check the SQL view"
msgstr "Could not check the SQL view"

msgid "Retry"
msgstr "Retry"

msgid "SQL view not installed"
msgstr "SQL view not installed"

msgid ""
"The tool needs an SQL view named \"{{name}}\" to count how often favorites "
"use each dimension. Creating it requires the \"Add/Update SQL view\" "
"authority. The view is public read-only and can be removed from this app at "
"any time."
msgstr ""
"The tool needs an SQL view named \"{{name}}\" to count how often favorites "
"use each dimension. Creating it requires the \"Add/Update SQL view\" "
"authority. The view is public read-only and can be removed from this app at "
"any time."

msgid "Create SQL view"
msgstr "Create SQL view"

msgid "SQL view needs an update"
msgstr "SQL view needs an update"

msgid ""
"An older version of the SQL view is installed (for example from the "
"Category dimension disabler, or for a different DHIS2 version). Update it "
"to include group sets and the current server version."
msgstr ""
"An older version of the SQL view is installed (for example from the "
"Category dimension disabler, or for a different DHIS2 version). Update it "
"to include group sets and the current server version."

msgid "Update SQL view"
msgstr "Update SQL view"

